<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15430" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρπεδόν-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cord,</i> for binding or snaring
			game, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.6.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.244
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Apollonid.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>yarn</i> of which cloth is made, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristias
				2
			</span></i> (ap.<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.31
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.160
			</span></i> (Antip. Sid.); <i>silk-worm's thread,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				6.26.8
			</span></i>; <i>bow-string,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				5.193
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Posidipp.
			</span></i> or <i><span class="en">
				Asclep.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρπεδόναι: τῶν ἀμαυρῶν ἄστρων
			σύγχυσις</span> (i.e. band of stars connecting Pisces), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				9.5.3
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
